  "id": 1761,
  "description": "Welcome to Wall St Bets! [Est. 08/15/2026]\n\nWe are a community of dedicated adventurers, crafters, and idle grinders climbing the ranks together in IdleMMO. Whether you are optimizing your daily tasks or pushing world bosses, you will find a home here.\n \nWhat We Offer:\n\n1. Guild Perks &amp; Boosts: Active bonuses to help speed up your leveling, gathering, and combat. Raids soon to come!\n\n2. Helpful &amp; Relaxed Community: A place to ask questions, and trade tips on gear and progression.\n\n3. All Playstyles Welcome: From casual idle enjoyers to daily min-maxers, every contribution helps the guild grow.\n\nRequirements:\n\n1. Stay active and contribute to guild challenges/stockpile when you can. If inactive for 30 days, you may be kicked.\n\n2. Have fun and enjoy the idle journey!\n\nInterested in joining? Apply directly in-game or send a message to the leader!",
